; error: 13:5: 'Color.paint' changes the value it is called on, so it needs a place that can change, and 'c' is 'bind' of a type with no contents that can change, so it acts as 'fixed'

kind Color
    Red
    Green
    alters paint()
        .this = Color.Green
    fi
fi

task main()
    bind c = Color.Red
    c.paint()
fi
